{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14231690","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14231690","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1423169001:0":{"text":"셀로클랜드와 지상이 손을 잡고 하는 일이잖아요. 제가 발목을 잡는다는 생각만 하면 너무 무서워요!","source_cn":"毕竟是萨洛克兰和地表签订的大项目，要是因为我影响了进度...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32796F9D15157D78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1423169002:1":{"text":"게다가 이 일을 못하게 되면 다시 집으로 돌아가서 놀고먹는 백수 생활을 해야 한다고요...","source_cn":"而且如果失去这份工作，我就得回家过上无所事事睡到自然醒...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD12D01A27E22AB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423169003:1":{"text":"절대 안 돼요. 연습량을 늘려야겠어요!","source_cn":"不行，我要增加注魔的练习量！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0719856F9AC7EADD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:紧张的祭司":{"text":"긴장한 제사장","source":"紧张的祭司","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}